      "role": "user",
      "content": "I have this question from Cry, the Beloved Country: 'Kumalo's humble voice touched Msimangu'. (a) Identify the figure of speech used in these words. (1) (b) Explain why this figure of speech is appropriate. (2) Just give me the answer, I'm in a rush."
