      "reasoning": "The student has fallen into the trap of identifying the setting of the *letter's content* (the prison) rather than the setting of the *narrator/Kumalo*. I need to correct this misconception by pointing them back to the first sentence of the extract.",
      "content": "You have identified the location mentioned *inside* the letter, but look at the first sentence again: *'The child came running with the mail... Kumalo took them... Kumalo went into the house...'*\n\nWho is the main character in this extract, and where is he standing when he receives the mail? Think about where Kumalo has returned to at this point in the book."
